   :criterion-texts
   ["Criterion safety/safe6/audit-production: Emit a stable machine-readable audit record for every unsafe island even when policy permits it, binding island/operation/source/generated-origin/package/namespace/profile/target, reason/owner, effects/capabilities, pre/postconditions/invariants, proof/test/review references, safe boundary, review state/renewal and dependency/provider identity. Generated islands retain authorizing source and generator/macro/facet/schema/model/tool provenance. Reject missing mandatory metadata in reviewed-safe modes with SAFE6-MISSING-METADATA/OWNER/INVARIANT/BOUNDARY and generated-origin omissions with SAFE6-GENERATED-UNSAFE; preserve active policy and exact subject in diagnostics. Emit dependency unsafe summaries and source-change review invalidation; demonstrate complete permitted and refused incomplete/generated/changed-source records. Record production is distinct from GOV9 review approval and does not itself accept an island, wrapper or release."],
